  "description": {
   "en": "This story was based on an episode that was not aired on TV and a script which was officially provided by Toei and was released in 2001 after Kamen Rider Kuuga's full televised run.\n\nThe oneshot takes place in between Kamen Rider Kuuga's Episode 22 and Episode 23.",
   "ja": "初出は2001年発売の「てれコロコミック」。\n\nストーリー原案は東映から公式に頂いたテレビ未放映エピソードで、\nそれを上山が２３ページの漫画にまとめたものです。"
  },
